{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>對於需要定時服藥或管理多種藥物的使用者來說，忘記用藥、藥物過期或庫存不足都是常見困擾。《MedicineTimes Pro》是一款專為個人用藥管理而設計的智能工具，能協助你集中記錄所有藥物資訊，並在關鍵時刻發出提醒。目前這款 App 正進行限時免費活動，讓你在無需付費的情況下享受完整功能。</p>\n\n<h2>核心功能介紹</h2>\n<p>最值得下載的功能之一是用藥上限無限制：無論是處方藥、非處方藥、維生素還是保健補充品，都能一次加入，完全不受數量限制。此外，App 會自動監控每項藥品的到期日，並在即將過期時提前通知，避免誤食過期藥物。低庫存提醒功能則能在藥量不足時發出警示，讓你及時補充，特別適合需要長期服用處方藥的使用者。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-21-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-22-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-23-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-24-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-25-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-26-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：MedicineTimes Pro</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-06T21:38:40.409849+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":351,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"unknown"}}